{"root":"sorak","ipa":"/ˈso.rak/","core":"欢呼、喝彩，指大声喊叫以表达喜悦、赞赏或支持。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈso.rak/","zh":"欢呼、喝彩","phrases":[{"t":"sorak sorai","zh":"欢呼雀跃"},{"t":"bersorak gembira","zh":"高兴地欢呼"},{"t":"sorak kemenangan","zh":"胜利的欢呼"}],"examples":[{"t":"Penonton bersorak saat pemain mencetak gol.","zh":"当球员进球时，观众们欢呼起来。"},{"t":"Mereka sorak-sorai menyambut kedatangan pahlawan itu.","zh":"他们欢呼雀跃地迎接那位英雄的到来。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"sorak","ipa":"/ˈso.rak/","zh":"欢呼（原型词）","phrase":{"t":"sorak ramai","zh":"喧闹的欢呼"},"example":{"t":"Terdengar sorak dari arah lapangan.","zh":"从操场方向传来了欢呼声。"}},{"w":"bersorak","ipa":"/bərˈso.rak/","zh":"欢呼、喝彩（不及物动词）","phrase":{"t":"bersorak kegirangan","zh":"因喜悦而欢呼"},"example":{"t":"Anak-anak bersorak melihat badut itu.","zh":"孩子们看到小丑时欢呼起来。"}},{"w":"menyuraki","ipa":"/mə.ɲuˈra.ki/","zh":"向……欢呼、为……喝彩","phrase":{"t":"menyuraki pemenang","zh":"为获胜者喝彩"},"example":{"t":"Massa menyuraki tim kesayangan mereka.","zh":"群众为他们喜爱的球队喝彩。"}},{"w":"sorakan","ipa":"/soˈra.kan/","zh":"欢呼声、喝彩声","phrase":{"t":"sorakan penonton","zh":"观众的欢呼声"},"example":{"t":"Sorakan itu memecah kesunyian malam.","zh":"那欢呼声打破了夜晚的寂静。"}}],"derSlugs":["sorak","bersorak","menyuraki","sorakan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:41:55.802Z","src":"base"}